summary:
  A row added on the settings page at the address another row was moved
  away from there takes that row's changes from the popup.

history:
  Page rows pair with the rows the page loaded first by their own name and
  uuid; a base row whose name and uuid a page row still carries elsewhere is
  that row's, not a newcomer's.

target:
  package/contents/ui/ReorderLogic.js

find:
              if (used[idx[j]] || _keyHeldElsewhere(base[idx[j]], cur, out)) continue

replace:
              if (used[idx[j]]) continue

expect:
  Killed by tst_reorderlogic::test_merge_gives_a_row_added_here_nothing_of_one_moved_away_here.
  Line-neutral.
